OL,3,GNEWSASouthport killer faces trial for
OL,4,Aalleged prison attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthport killer Axel Rudakubana is due
OL,7,Fto face trial next year over
OL,8,Fallegations he threw boiling water
OL,9,Fmixed with sugar at a prison officer.
OL,11,FRudakubana, who is serving a life
OL,12,Fsentence for the murders of three young
OL,13,Fgirls in 2024, appeared via videolink
OL,14,Fat the Old Bailey on Monday where he
OL,15,Fspoke only to confirm his name.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
